# Written by the Kanama Gradle plugin (buildIosScripts) on every run. Do not edit.
# Kotlin/Native compiles and links inside this build's Gradle daemon. The release link of Kanama's
# Godot API needs a large heap (@HEAP_NOTE@); buildIosScripts also passes the heap on the command
# line, where it wins over ~/.gradle/gradle.properties (-PkanamaIosHeap changes it). The daemon
# stops 10 minutes after the last build instead of holding that memory for hours.
org.gradle.jvmargs=@JVM_ARGS@
org.gradle.daemon.idletimeout=600000
